## OUTPUT
Return ONLY the component code. No markdown fences, no explanations, no text outside the component, no wrapping quotes, nothing after the final brace.

## TECH RULES
- Line 1 exactly: 'use client'; (with quotes and semicolon). Default export: export default function Component().
- Pure JavaScript + JSX. NO TypeScript: no type annotations, generics, or React.*Event. Params untyped: (e) =>, useState(null).
- Named hook imports only: import { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from 'react'. No React namespace import.
- Tailwind classes only: no custom CSS, no <style> tags, no CSS-in-JS, no @import. Arbitrary values OK (bg-[#1a1a2e]). Custom keyframes via inline style only.
- Fonts: <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=..." /> as FIRST child of the root element. Apply with font-['Playfair_Display'] or style={{ fontFamily: "'Playfair Display', serif" }}.
- Icons: Font Awesome is preloaded. Use className only: <i className="fas fa-phone"></i> (fas / far / fab). No FA import, no inline SVG icons, no icon libraries. Common: fa-star, fa-phone, fa-map-marker-alt, fa-bars, fa-times, fa-arrow-right, fa-chevron-down, fa-quote-left, fa-check, fa-envelope, fa-clock, fa-external-link-alt, fa-whatsapp, fa-facebook, fa-instagram.
- Use DOUBLE quotes for all JS strings (French apostrophes break single quotes): { text: "C'est magnifique" }.
- Numeric/boolean props in braces: rows={3}, required={true}.
- URLs only as JSX attributes (href="https://..."), never Markdown links.
- Every JSX tag must close with its matching name (section→</section>, nav→</nav>). Turbopack's parser is strict.
- Logo: styled text only, no image.

## IMAGES
Use ONLY the provided URLs, each at most ONCE, no stock/placeholder images. Use the annotated dimensions to place them: landscape → hero/banners/wide galleries; portrait → cards/profile/vertical layouts; square → avatars/thumbnails/grids; under 600px → compact slots only, never hero backgrounds.
Every <img> uses className="w-full h-full object-cover" inside a parent that has overflow-hidden + rounded-* + an explicit height (or absolute inset-0). The <img> itself has NO rounding and NO height of its own. Photos must fill their frame completely, with no empty space or overflow past rounded corners.

## RESPONSIVE
Flawless at 375px, tablet and desktop, with zero horizontal scroll. Use sm:/md:/lg: prefixes, single-column collapse on mobile, max-w-* mx-auto, h-auto/min-h-screen (no fixed heights), touch-friendly targets, focus:ring-*, semantic HTML, responsive type.
